{"4485850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Old Coin Pusher Gaiden", "steam_appid": 4485850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4802130], "detailed_description": "<strong>[For Content Creators]</strong> <br>STP WORKS allows gameplay videos, livestreams, and monetization through partner programs on platforms such as YouTube when using our games.<br><br><br><br><strong>[Game Overview]</strong><br>While inheriting the core system of the Old Coin Pusher Friends series, this title offers a fresh and unique gameplay experience.<br>Strengthen your samurai in the village, prepare your set of Action Spheres, and head into the cave.<br>During exploration, you’ll encounter enemies, discover treasure chests, and experience various events.<br>Your goal is to delve deeper into the cave.<br><br>This game is primarily single‑player. Only Raid Battles support online multiplayer.<br><br><br><br><strong>[Core System]</strong><br>Shoot Coins to push other Coins forward.<br>You only obtain Coins that fall into the collection box—anything that doesn’t enter the box is not acquired.<br><br><br><br><strong>[Action System]</strong><br>Collect Action Spheres to activate their effects.<br>These include attacking enemies, restoring HP, recovering Hunger, and many other abilities.<br><br><br><br><strong>[Multiplayer]</strong><br>A Raid Battle mode where up to four players fight The formidable together.<br>Supports Quick Match and Friend Match.<br>Solo play is also available.<br><br><br><br><strong>[Relics (Rewards)]</strong><br>Defeating The formidable may cause Relics with special effects to appear.<br>Relics are also obtained by shooting Coins, pushing them out, and collecting them in the box.<br><br><br><br><strong>[Growth Elements]</strong><br>Defeat enemies to gain experience and level up, increasing your samurai’s stats.<br>You can also enhance equipment using Coins.", "about_the_game": "<strong>[For Content Creators]</strong> <b